        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Over the last 2–3 weeks, stool frequency increased to 2–3 times daily from a baseline of once daily. No overt diarrhoea, blood, mucus, weight loss or nocturnal gastrointestinal symptoms."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
