          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Past medical history unremarkable. No history of migraine, chronic headache, epilepsy, known parasitic infection, malignancy or immunosuppression. No anticoagulation or pregnancy reported in the red-flag screen. Clinically described as immunocompetent; no known eosinophilia."
