        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Chef in a busy metropolitan restaurant, working long hours in a hot environment with high stress. Often skips breaks, has suboptimal hydration and irregular meals. Reduced sleep, poor sleep hygiene, late-night screen use, prolonged standing, posture strain and concentration at work late into the night were assessed as contributing to headache."
